    m_Localized: Current battle progress will be lost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1052854216364032
    m_Localized: 'Send spies to enemy ports?


      <color=#FFFFFF>This will allow
      you to see enemy resources for one battle.

      Cost depends on the number
      of enemy ports

      </color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2051063634006016
    m_Localized: Some images were generated or enhanced using AI
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054715362840576
    m_Localized: 'I''m fine with it!

      Start the game'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2054766403325952
    m_Localized: 'This is offensive!

      Exit the game'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2397459969019904
    m_Localized: Support
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
