    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6062456007888896
    m_Localized: 'Victory!

      We never doubted you, Captain!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6062483853873152
    m_Localized: 'Defeat!

      We are disappointed in you, Captain!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6354334670458880
    m_Localized: Campaigns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6427000718823424
    m_Localized: Load campaign?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6444741970432000
    m_Localized: 'This will destroy all progress data!

      Recovery will be impossible!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6448809807777792
    m_Localized: I agree!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6449739378790400
    m_Localized: Delete!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6463067136266240
    m_Localized: Delete saves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2393996019175424
    m_Localized: 'Hello!

      I''m a solo developer who loves interesting games
      and hates being bombarded with useless information.

      My goal is to make
      cool games that you actually want to play, without being distracted by all
      kinds of nonsense.

      That''s why I fundamentally don''t add any ads to
      my games, so players can comfortably and fully immerse themselves in discovering
      a new, interesting world.

      If you share my views and would like to support
      me, you can do so by making a purchase in the Item Catalog.

      Thank you!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
